    "message": "**🍒✨ Attention, my Berry-Licious Devs! ✨🍓**  \n\n---\n\n🌸💖 **Heads Up, Sweeties!** 💖🌸  \n\nThe *cherry-kissed* version **1.0.1** had a little oopsie-daisy 🍒 (a teeny bug snuck in! 🐞✨), so it’s been **deprecated**. 🥲💔  \n\n---\n\n🌟 But don’t worry, sugarplums! 🍓✨ The new **1.1.0** is here and *sparkling* with all the fixes and extra sweetness you deserve! 🎀🍒  \n\n✨ **Please upgrade to v1.1.0 for the smoothest, bug-free berry magic ever!** 💖🍓  \n\n---\n\n📖 **Need help, gorgeous?**  \nCheck out the **README.md** file for all the juicy details! 🍒✨ It’s packed with cute and easy examples to help you sprinkle berry magic into your project! 🎀🍓  \n\n---\n\n**#UpgradeToBerryPerfection** 🍒💅  \nBecause every code deserves a cherry on top! 🌸💖✨",
